WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.630
<i>It is the 25th year of the Taisho Era.</i>

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:06.530
<i>The sight of her younger brother 
enveloped in flames, clutching a book—</i>

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:11.190
<i>known as a cursed tome—greatly 
fluctuates the fate of one girl.</i>

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:14.090
<i>This is the story of Kuze 
Tsugumi and her encounters.</i>

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:54.460
Well? Pretty nice, isn't it?

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:56.920
Yes, it's very lovely.

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:00.970
Um... Ozaki-san?

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.470
You cut your hair.

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:08.120
Oh, this... Is it weird?

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:10.140
It's great! It suits you!

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:14.300
Thank you.

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:19.860
The Imperial Library Intelligence 
Asset Management Bureau

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:19.860
-Fukurou-

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:24.370
Tokimiya-san had planned 
to be here to greet you,

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.730
but she was called to a 
meeting on short notice.

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:31.020
No, I should apologize for imposing 
upon your time, Ozaki-san.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:35.330
Uh... Y'know, you can speak more casually.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:38.730
Speaking so formally is a hassle, right?

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:41.090
You can just call me Hayato, too.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:42.740
But that would be...

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:46.580
I'm really glad you're here.

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:47.850
Now, come this way.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:52.730
A basement?

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:54.730
It's this room.

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:57.350
Go on in.

00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.240
Pardon the intrusion.

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:04.360
This is the Imperial Library Intelligence 
Asset Management Bureau

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:06.490
Investigation Division's strategy room.

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:08.140
Investigation?

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:08.750
Yeah.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:12.880
Fukurou has two divisions,
Investigation and Research.

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:14.330
To put it simply,

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:18.380
in Investigation, under Tokimiya-san, 
our duty is to search for cursed tomes.

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:21.800
Research's duty is to examine them.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:27.390
And... this is the room where we 
temporarily store the cursed tomes.

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:56.760
Are you okay?

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:01.880
Yes, it just startled me a bit.

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:08.760
There are so many of them.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:11.740
Tsugumi-kun.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:16.520
So you really did gain the ability to see them.

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.700
N-Nabari-san?

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:31.950
It's been a while. Several years, I believe.

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:34.510
What are you doing here?

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:37.960
I can also see the auras.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:42.970
Nabari-san is researching 
the cursed tomes here.

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:45.970
I was surprised when I 
heard that he knew you.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:49.360
After staying with the Kuze 
family as a student houseboy,

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:51.020
I found employment here.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.800
I then learned of the 
existence of the cursed tomes

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:55.980
and realized that I could see their auras.

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:00.480
I heard what happened to Hitaki-kun.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:03.660
It truly puts me at a loss for words.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:04.490
I know...

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:10.320
Which is why I want to do what I can.

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.000
Yes. Thank you for that.

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.210
Tokimiya-san!

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.210
Welcome, my lady, to Fukurou.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:22.910
Thank you.

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:25.380
Huh? Back already?

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:26.220
Yes.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.240
I'll show her around from here.

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:30.920
Aw, come on!

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:32.580
Kuze, this way.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:33.350
Right!

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.380
Good luck on patrol.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.360
Come on, let's go.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:40.150
Okay!

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:43.150
Tch...

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:47.620
Guess I'll take this up to her room, then.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:53.790
I can't believe you have a 
path like this underground.

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:57.420
It's what you'd call a secret passage.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:59.880
Now, up ahead is the Research Division.

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:09.690
Wow, there are so many books.

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:13.970
And so many strange things.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.180
You're the new recruit, Kuze-san, correct?

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:27.410
Hello, hello! I am the head of the 
Research Division, Mashiko Motofumi.

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:28.320
Pleased to meet you.

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:32.160
Don't worry. Despite how he looks, he's human.

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:33.200
Huh?

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.720
That's a mask.

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:37.730
Huh? Oh!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:42.680
Hello. My name is Kuze Tsugumi.

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:44.280
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:47.850
No need to be so frightened.

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:52.320
Despite his appearance, Mashiko 
is well-versed in various fields.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:58.250
That's right! I am particularly fond of 
the fields of folklore and ornithology.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:01.730
And this is a rare mask 
from my favorite tribe.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:04.730
It took me four years to get my hands on it.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:08.490
It's far too precious to be a mere 
decoration, so I always wear it.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:08.990
Okay, okay, that's enough. Time to move on.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:16.990
What do you think?

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:18.500
It's amazing.

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:20.420
Isn't it marvelous?

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:24.750
This is currently the only 
national library in this country.

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:28.720
Fukurou was originally one of 
the departments for collecting

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:31.810
and managing precious 
books at home and abroad.

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:35.840
We are still diligently 
performing that role, even now.

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:43.650
Novice Fukurou member, we welcome 
you from the bottom of our hearts.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:45.840
Yes! Thank you very much!

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.960
In this building, the men's 
rooms are on the second floor,

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:52.370
and the women's are on the third floor.

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:55.700
This is your room.

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:57.850
Well, go on in.

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:01.280
What do you think?

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:03.700
It can't compare to the room 
of a young noble lady,

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:04.960
but it's not bad, right?

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:09.460
Yes, it's wonderful. This is 
my first time in an apartment.

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:12.210
My room is at the far end of the hall.

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:14.140
If you need anything, let me know.

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:15.030
I will.

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:18.580
All right, you can take it 
easy until this evening.

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:20.220
Thank you.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:40.930
It's so lovely.

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:43.690
Goldfish, goldfish...

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:44.750
Goldfish?

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:49.000
Goldfish, goldfish...

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:55.350
Goldfish, goldfish...

00:08:57.240 --> 00:09:00.740
Goldfish, goldfish...

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:11.750
Bonjour, mademoiselle.

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:13.780
Do you like goldfish?

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:18.020
I haven't seen you around here 
before. Did you just move in?

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:19.780
Um, well...

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.350
I know. Since you're here,

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:25.060
why don't you come to the café 
with me and have some tea?

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:26.790
P-Please excuse me!

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:33.880
<i>There's a man like that here, 
too? I have to be careful!</i>

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:40.900
Excuse me.

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:44.300
Up here.

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:47.740
Would you happen to be Kuze Tsugumi-san?

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:55.360
My name is Hoshikawa Hisui.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:56.950
I'm a member of Fukurou.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.540
Oh, I'm Kuze Tsugumi.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.370
I'll be working with you starting today.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:06.670
So... you can see the auras of cursed tomes?

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:07.960
Yes.

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:12.610
I heard someone with that ability was coming.
I've looked forward to meeting you.

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:16.090
I, too—no...

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:21.770
I look forward to working with you.

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:23.860
Well, then, I'll see you later.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:30.600
What a beautiful person.

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:35.610
Okay, time to start the newbie welcome party!

00:10:35.850 --> 00:10:37.320
Look at all this sushi!

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:38.370
I've been waiting for this!

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:39.740
It all looks so good!

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:42.100
Go on, eat as much as you'd like.

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:43.240
Time to eat!

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:49.970
Well, that's all for me.

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:52.480
Glad to be working with you.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:53.990
Oh, yes.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:58.000
Is something the matter with Kougami-san?

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.750
Oh, don't mind him.

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:03.140
He's not so great with social 
situations like this.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:05.760
He doesn't talk with us much, either.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:10.770
Oh? You all seem to be 
eating something delicious.

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:12.240
Shizuru.

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:15.790
So you were the newcomer after all.

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:17.030
H-Huh?

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:23.180
A beguiling new flower has bloomed 
in this apartment building at last.

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:25.530
Could this be fate, as well?

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:28.100
Tokimiya-san, who is this?

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:31.100
He's Migiwa Shizuru, an author who lives here.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.520
What?!

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:37.800
Might you have read one of my books?

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.330
Blazing Coffin

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:41.380
Well, my brother is a big fan of yours.

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:41.330
Birdcage in the Summer Haze
Migiwa Shizuru

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:44.140
In other words, you <i>aren't</i>.

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:46.640
Oh, no, that's not what I meant.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:51.620
Shizuru-san, she's here to work, you know.

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:54.620
But she is free beyond that, correct?

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:57.410
You have no right to restrain her.

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:58.360
That's true.

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:01.900
Come, now, you two. 
The sushi is going to get cold.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:03.580
That's not how that works.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:04.910
Thank you for the food.

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.990
<i>So he's Migiwa Shizuru-sensei.</i>

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:14.130
You can call me "Shizuru-san," princess.

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:23.930
Okay!

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:32.540
A perfect day for patrolling.

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:34.390
Indeed, such nice weather.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:37.010
When will our princess appear?

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.360
Good morning.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.160
My, my.

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:52.910
Um, isn't this a bit strange?

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.920
The skirt also seems too short.

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.480
Not at all!

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:59.220
I think shorter is better. 
It's easier to move in!

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:00.200
Right, Hisui?

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:01.520
That's right!

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:05.300
Many women are wearing short-length 
Western clothing lately.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:09.220
Personally, I think it could 
stand to be even shorter.

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:15.050
Okay, now that we're all here,

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:18.220
this is Kuze's first day, 
so we'll all go together.

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:18.940
Oh?

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:22.360
Will Tokimiya-san not be joining us?

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:25.490
She is basically the head of our organization,

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:27.950
so she doesn't typically go out on patrols.

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:29.880
I see...

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:34.450
<i>Then that means I'm the only girl?</i>

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.210
For good luck on your first day.

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:42.300
Now, go do your best.

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:44.480
I will!

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:51.640
Hey!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:55.600
Why have you been walking so 
far behind us this whole time?

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:58.600
R-Right! I'm sorry!

00:14:04.060 --> 00:14:07.020
Are we walking too quickly for you?

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:09.190
No, that's not it.

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:11.870
If you feel unwell or 
something, just tell us.

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:13.140
Okay.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.870
<i>Should I be walking alongside members of 
the opposite sex when they're not family?</i>

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.910
<i>I have to walk with them.</i>

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.140
Mornin'!

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:41.240
Hey, good work on your patrols today.

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:43.650
Got anything good for us, Kuina-san?

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:47.440
Yes, I've been waiting for you.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:51.000
Oh, is the young lady there new?

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.760
Nice to meet you. My name is Kuze Tsugumi.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:56.290
I would appreciate your continued support.

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:57.780
Charmed.

00:14:57.780 --> 00:15:01.200
I'm Kuina, the owner of this shop.

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:07.300
As you can see, we have not just books, 
but various other things that I like.

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:10.080
It's a lovely shop.

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:14.550
Isn't it? You're welcome here anytime.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:17.020
<i>Is that a stuffed animal?</i>

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:25.570
It's alive?!

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:30.820
Ah, that would be Perry.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:34.400
I found him in some baggage 
from overseas some time ago.

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:35.880
Isn't he adorable?

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.170
<i>They have these kinds of creatures overseas?</i>

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:45.120
He seems to have taken a liking to you.

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.590
That's pretty unusual.

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:48.780
Nice to meet you, Perry.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:53.270
By the way, is there a man in your life?

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:54.340
I'm sorry?

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:57.150
Would you like me to be your lover?

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:58.600
Or maybe your sweetheart?

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:03.240
I don't have any interest 
in boys or marriage.

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:09.830
Kuina-san, Kuze-san can see 
the auras of cursed tomes.

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:12.030
Well, that's surprising.

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.500
Let's see...

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:17.620
Here. This Japanese-style 
book just came in today.

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:20.260
Please allow me to check it.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:28.710
Well?

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:39.260
I'm sorry, but I believe this 
is just an ordinary book.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:41.270
Why are you apologizing?

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.580
Shimotakahara Bookstore

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:48.060
They don't have any Japanese-style books.

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:51.440
This is an ordinary book.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:54.700
They're all ordinary books.

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:56.830
This isn't one, either.

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:04.460
Kuze-san seems to be bothered by the fact 
that we haven't found any cursed tomes yet.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:06.790
They aren't something you can find easily.

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:10.000
<i>We haven't found anything all day.</i>

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.550
Hey, Kuze!

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:13.850
You're falling behind again.

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:16.010
Right! I'm sorry!

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:20.080
Sasagoi Bookstore

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:24.120
Well, let's go.

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:29.170
Pardon the intrusion.

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:30.690
Excuse us.

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:33.690
Good afternoon, Sasagoi-san.

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:35.950
Sasagoi-san!

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:39.700
Oh, it's you guys.

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:43.080
I didn't notice you. Sorry about that.

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:45.460
No, we apologize.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:47.850
Forgive us for taking up your time.

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:49.460
Who's that?

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:53.340
Forgive my delayed introduction. 
My name is Kuze.

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:55.150
Hello.

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:59.840
Taking on a new recruit when you
barely get any results as it is?

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:01.600
How are things?

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:04.120
Anything that resembles a cursed tome?

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:06.850
Nope.

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:09.580
We'll just take a look around.

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:11.110
Go ahead.

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:14.470
Honestly...

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:18.610
Having suspicious characters like you 
in my store drives customers away.

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:21.420
We request your understanding in this matter.

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:26.750
Well, then, we'll be going for today.

00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:29.300
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:32.510
Um...

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:35.510
Thank you very much.

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:42.430
What are they thinking, taking on 
more useless good-for-nothings?

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:43.510
Honestly...

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:56.780
<i>What are they thinking, taking on 
more useless good-for-nothings?</i>

00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:59.280
Oh, excuse me.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:07.910
Huh? Ozaki-san? Kougami-san? Hoshikawa-san?

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:13.820
<i>No, I have to keep it together!</i>

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.170
Kuze!

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:18.170
What are you doing? You had me worried!

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:20.760
I told you to keep up with us!

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:22.860
I'm sorry.

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:24.180
Kuze-san!

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:25.520
There you are.

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:26.680
What a relief.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.680
Please don't worry about it.

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:34.080
Hayato was only hard on you 
because he was worried.

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:35.780
Okay.

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:38.540
Our rounds for today are 
over after the next shop.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:40.440
Just hang in there for one more.

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:42.950
Ohbayashi Bookstore

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:42.950
Ah, Fukurou-san!

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.820
I've been waiting for you!

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:48.260
Whoa, Ohbayashi-san! You're too close!

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:49.980
Now, what's the matter?

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:53.040
A J-J-Japanese-style book! 
A Japanese-style book!

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:53.040
Too close!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.470
Where is it, Ohbayashi-san?

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:55.750
C-Calm down.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:56.830
It's over there.

00:19:56.830 --> 00:20:00.070
Honestly, I'm not sure if 
it's a cursed tome or not,

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:03.460
but there was a notice from the higher-ups 
that we should keep it here...

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:05.350
But I've been so scared!

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:07.240
Just calm down!

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:10.350
Am I going to be cursed?!

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:10.350
You're too close! Too close!

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:14.350
No, you won't end up cursed 
or anything just by having it.

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:15.680
Kuze.

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:17.230
Oh, yes!

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:24.200
Who is that young lady? 
I've never seen her before.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.870
Just leave this to her.

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:28.310
This one.

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:29.660
Thank you.

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:40.500
Well?

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:43.630
I don't see any aura.

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:46.640
This is not a cursed tome.

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:48.990
Listen, um...

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.630
Thank goodness!

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:54.140
So I won't be cursed, then?!

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:56.880
As I said, that's not how
a cursed tome works.

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.980
It's all thanks to you, young lady!

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:02.160
You really saved me. You're my lifesaver!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:04.400
Thank you, too, Kougami-san!

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:06.300
Oh, uh, right...

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:07.520
You're a bit close.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.460
You did it.

00:21:07.520 --> 00:21:09.940
I'm so relieved! thank you so much!

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:11.800
But I haven't found any cursed tomes.

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:11.800
I thought I was going to die!

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:12.640
See that?

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:13.450
Huh?

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:18.670
We confirmed that it <i>isn't</i> a cursed 
tome because of your power.

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:22.910
And that man over there is 
so happy because of you.

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:28.230
You, too, Hoshikawa-san! 
Thank you so very much!

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:29.680
Not at all. I'm glad.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:31.130
Y-You're too close.

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:35.160
Also, I went too far earlier.

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:34.300
Please continue looking 
after me, Fukurou-san!

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:36.620
Yes, of course, but you're still too close.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:36.190
Sorry.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:39.240
And I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:41.760
Thank you, Ozaki-san.

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:43.920
I told you, be a little more casual.

00:21:44.390 --> 00:21:46.200
U-Um...

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:49.970
Thanks... Hayato.

00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:53.200
Sure.

00:21:53.780 --> 00:21:55.960
Hey, could you say my name again?

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:57.180
I will not!

00:23:19.860 --> 00:23:22.680
<i>Hello, hello! It is I, Mashiko Motofumi.</i>

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:36.280
Chapter 3:  "Those Who Take the Name
of the God of Flames -Kagutsuchi-"

00:23:22.680 --> 00:23:24.420
<i>What do you think of Fukurou?</i>

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:27.960
<i>You should take your time increasing 
your skills without rushing.</i>

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:33.200
<i>I'm sure there will be joyful and painful 
times ahead, but please do your best.</i>

00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:36.520
<i>I know! Perhaps you should 
wear this mask, too.</i>

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.020
<i>You don't want it? How unfortunate.</i>
